# Graphify corpus scoping — see docs/graphify-developer-guide.md and ADR-041.
#
# Graphify honours .gitignore by default, so build output and vendored code are
# already excluded. This file narrows the corpus further to what is worth
# graphing.

# Implemented feature specs. 2,851 markdown files / ~2.6M words — 15x the size
# of the living-documentation corpus, and their value was banked when the
# features shipped. Deliberately out of scope; revisit as a separate graph.
specs/

# Generated from LinkML. These appear as heavily-imported hubs that no human
# should edit, and the graph cannot link them back to the schema that produced
# them anyway (no AST parser sees across a code generator).
shared/schemas/src/generated/

# Data and configuration files. tree-sitter parses JSON, but 882 of them
# produced zero nodes on the first full run — pure noise in the graph.
*.json
*.geojson
*.rep
*.dpf

# Test fixtures and sample corpora, including the vendored STAC Browser bundle
# (minified third-party JS — parses fine, contributes only noise).
preview/workspace/samples/
apps/vscode/test-data/
apps/web-shell/test-fixtures/
**/__fixtures__/

# Evidence artefacts (screenshots, videos, captured output).
evidence/
**/evidence/
